Bambu A1 Maestro is an independent community project, not affiliated with
or endorsed by Bambu Lab, Google, OpenAI or Anthropic.

Bambu Studio and its profiles are not bundled. The slicing helper reads the
user's installed profiles and invokes the installed Bambu Studio executable.
references/perfiles_oficiales_a1.md documents observed configuration values;
the installed profiles remain the source of truth.

NotebookLM / Gemini Notebook integration uses the separately installed
third-party project https://github.com/jacob-bd/gemini-notebook-mcp-cli.
That CLI, its skill, and all Python dependencies retain their own licenses.
No notebooks, account identifiers, credentials or models are distributed.
